<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<lpdf version="1"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../../schema/lpdf.xsd">
  <tokens>
    <colors>
      <color name="primary" value="#1763cf" />
      <color name="muted"   value="#737373" />
      <color name="alert"   value="#d0021b" />
      <color name="box"     value="#eef2f8" />
    </colors>
  </tokens>
  <document size="a4">
    <meta title="lpdf Showcase — Spans in aligned text" subject="align=right and align=center: a line with spans ends at the right edge or is centered, its spans in order" />

    <!-- A right-aligned or centered line with spans is placed as a whole: it starts its width back from the right
         edge, or half of it from the middle, and its words and spans follow one another from there. The shaded box
         behind each text is the box it aligns in. Expected, on page 1:
           - every line ends at the right edge of its box in the left column, and is centered in its box in the
             right column, its spans included
           - each span follows the words before it, with no overlap, and stays inside its box
           - the line under an underlined span, the line through a struck one, the tint behind a code span and the
             link area of a linked one are under the span's own words
           - the number of a footnote stays on the word it follows
           - a text that wraps aligns each of its lines on its own
           - a text with no span draws as it always has
           - the header, right-aligned, holds a cross-reference in color, and the footer, centered, a link
         On page 2, a Markdown table with a right-aligned and a centered column keeps the bold words, the italic
         words, the code and the link of each cell in order, inside the cell.
    -->
    <section>
      <layout margin="40pt">
        <region pin="top">
          <text font-size="s" color="muted" align="right">Harbor terms · <span bookmark-ref="cases" color="primary">{bookmark-label}, page {bookmark-page}</span></text>
        </region>
        <column gap="l">
          <column gap="xs">
            <text font-size="xxl" font="Helvetica-Bold" color="primary">Spans in aligned text</text>
            <text font-size="m" color="muted">Right-aligned on the left, centered on the right, each in its shaded box.</text>
          </column>

          <bookmark id="cases" label="The cases"/>
          <row gap="m" align="start">
            <column gap="s" width="fill">
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Color</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">Notice: <span color="alert">clause 4, page 3</span></text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Font</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">Paid in <span font="Helvetica-Bold">full</span> on delivery</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Link</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">See <span href="https://lpdf.io" color="primary">the terms</span> now</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Underline</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">See <span underline="true">the terms</span> now</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Strike</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">Was <span strike="true">$40.00</span> now $35.00</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Code span</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">Run <code-span>make test</code-span> first</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Footnote</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">See the terms<fn>The terms are in the appendix.</fn> now</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Wrapped</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">The <span color="alert">first clause</span> covers every order placed after the start of the term, and <span href="https://lpdf.io" color="primary" underline="true">the terms</span> say what <span font="Helvetica-Bold">a notice</span> must hold.</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">No span</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="right">Notice: clause 4, page 3</text></column>
            </column>
            <column gap="s" width="fill">
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Color</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">Notice: <span color="alert">clause 4, page 3</span></text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Font</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">Paid in <span font="Helvetica-Bold">full</span> on delivery</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Link</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">See <span href="https://lpdf.io" color="primary">the terms</span> now</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Underline</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">See <span underline="true">the terms</span> now</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Strike</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">Was <span strike="true">$40.00</span> now $35.00</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Code span</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">Run <code-span>make test</code-span> first</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Footnote</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">See the terms<fn>The terms are kept with the harbor master.</fn> now</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">Wrapped</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">The <span color="alert">first clause</span> covers every order placed after the start of the term, and <span href="https://lpdf.io" color="primary" underline="true">the terms</span> say what <span font="Helvetica-Bold">a notice</span> must hold.</text></column>
              <text font-size="s" color="muted">No span</text>
              <column background="box"><text align="center">Notice: clause 4, page 3</text></column>
            </column>
          </row>
        </column>
        <region pin="bottom">
          <text font-size="s" color="muted" align="center">Page {page} · <span href="https://lpdf.io" color="primary">lpdf.io</span></text>
        </region>
      </layout>
    </section>
    <section>
      <markdown margin="40pt">
        <markdown-content><![CDATA[
          # Aligned columns of a Markdown table

          The second column is right-aligned and the third centered. Each cell keeps its bold and italic words, its code and its link in order.

          | Item | Right | Center |
          |:-----|------:|:------:|
          | Oil | Pay **now** or see [terms](https://lpdf.io) | Pay **now** or see [terms](https://lpdf.io) |
          | Wick | *Due* in `30` days | *Due* in `30` days |
          | Plain | 12.00 | 12.00 |
        ]]></markdown-content>
      </markdown>
    </section>
  </document>
</lpdf>
